      "basis": "Source inspection.",
      "detail": "Roads restoreTransaction propagates rebuildNow false, but roads:rebuilt still emits after a caught failure; Tools road commit ignores rebuild return and restoreHeightRect ignores its internal road rebuild result. Broad every-owner-call-checked wording is inaccurate.",
      "next": "Publish successful completion only after success and distinguish initial commit/height-rebuild failures from the verified inverse path."
    },
